u064-q-bc79e2ff7fe0cc5495b3","source_order":[64,90,0],"related_events":[{"event":"shaodi-e-o129a","type":"related","evidence":["santizhu064-q-bc79e2ff7fe0cc5495b3","shaodi-e-o129a-q"]},{"event":"chenghuang-e-o156","type":"related","evidence":["chenghuang-q-0cf97fa905c953017d83","santizhu064-q-bc79e2ff7fe0cc5495b3"]}],"order":11016}],"persons":[{"id":"santizhu-p0163","name":"黎斐","evidence":["santizhu064-q-bc79e2ff7fe0cc5495b3","chenghuang-q-0cf97fa905c953017d83"],"facts":[],"aliases":[],"mentions":[]}],"evidence":[{"id":"chenghuang-q-0cf97fa905c953017d83","section":"chapter-055","block":"b-8df1d46a00b273a6bbbc","layer":"original","quote":"太平二年，〔魏大将军诸葛诞据寿春来降，〕魏人围之。遣朱异、唐咨等往救，复使奉与黎斐解围。奉为先登，屯于黎浆〖10〗；力战有功，拜左将军","section_title":"程黄韩蒋周陈董甘凌徐潘丁传第十","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0117.xhtml","index":358,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":0,"end":67},{"id":"santizhu064-q-4ee6b68e68a3fac3ca3f","section":"chapter-064","block":"b-390d7a804c8a1bdac217","layer":"original","quote":"魏大将军诸葛诞举寿春叛，保城请降。吴遣文钦、唐咨、全端、全怿等帅三万人救之。魏镇南将军王基，围诞〖1〗，钦等突围入城","section_title":"诸葛滕二孙濮阳传第十九","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0135.xhtml","index":439,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":0,"end":58},{"id":"santizhu064-q-bc79e2ff7fe0cc5495b3","section":"chapter-064","block":"b-f1f75337999ea6de2e8a","layer":"original","quote":"綝于是大发卒，出屯镬里〖4〗；复遣异率将军丁奉、黎斐等五万人，攻魏，留辎重于都陆","section_title":"诸葛滕二孙濮阳传第十九","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0135.xhtml","index":440,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":0,"end":40},{"id":"shaodi-e-o129a-q","section":"chapter-004","block":"b-b1abcd215d0c852fc17c","layer":"original","quote":"三年春二月〖1〗，大将军司马文王陷寿春城，斩诸葛诞。三月，诏曰：“古者克敌，收其尸以为京观〖2〗，所以惩昏逆而彰武功也。汉孝武元鼎中〖3〗，改桐乡为闻喜〖4〗，新乡为获嘉〖5〗，以著南越之亡〖6〗。大将军亲总六戎〖7〗，营据丘头〖8〗；内夷群凶〖9〗，外殄寇虏〖10〗；功济兆民，声振四海。克敌之地，宜有令名〖11〗：其改‘丘头’为‘武丘’。明以武平乱，后世不忘；亦京观、二邑之义也〖12〗”。","section_title":"三少帝纪第四","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0013_split_000.xhtml","index":575,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":0,"end":197}],"profiles":{},"directory_counts":{}}
